{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_10105050","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10105050","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:6:1010505001:0":{"text":"奇怪……那两个守卫的盔甲，是不是和之前见到的都不太一样？","source_cn":"奇怪……那两个守卫的盔甲，是不是和之前见到的都不太一样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x678565CC2177976D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1010505002:0":{"text":"他们不像是弗朗茨的直属卫兵，也不像是那些雇佣兵。","source_cn":"他们不像是弗朗茨的直属卫兵，也不像是那些雇佣兵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B9C1DD221FCBFA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1010505003:0":{"text":"是<style=\"highlight\">黑金商会</style>！","source_cn":"是<style=highlight>黑金商会</sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x569D8F9B8848FDDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1010505004:0":{"text":"错不了……我认识他们胸前的标志。","source_cn":"错不了……我认识他们胸前的标志。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C2F3E1BD61C91C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1010505005:0":{"text":"那是<style=\"highlight\">黑金商会</style>的印记！","source_cn":"那是<style=highlight>黑金商会</st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1243CF4E1FFCB2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1010505006:0":{"text":"既然洞窟里有密道，难道他们在帮弗朗茨看守密道？","source_cn":"既然洞窟里有密道，难道他们在帮弗朗茨看守密道？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x820BA36BA2B449DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1010505007:0":{"text":"管他呢，打一顿就该招了。","source_cn":"管他呢，打一顿就该招了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2F2DDAD4E73B374","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1010505008:0":{"text":"等等！别忘了我们要潜入宅邸，这会儿打起来，不就暴露行踪了吗？","source_cn":"等等！别忘了我们要潜入宅邸，这会儿打起来，不就暴露行踪了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x431C1E7F1F1783EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1010505009:0":{"text":"都给我冷静点！要谨慎行事。","source_cn":"都给我冷静点！要谨慎行事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09C2B66936C861FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1010505010:0":{"text":"我只是开个玩笑，用不着你提醒。","source_cn":"我只是开个玩笑，用不着你提醒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FA8DB1040AADF72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1010505011:0":{"text":"既然不能采取强硬手段，只能想个办法把他们引开了。","source_cn":"既然不能采取强硬手段，只能想个办法把他们引开了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D3D6532648A95AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1010505012:0":{"text":"让我去吧！我来想办法引开守卫，你们找机会溜进密道。","source_cn":"让我去吧！我来想办法引开守卫，你们找机会溜进密道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFEA6675112ABA70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1010505013:0":{"text":"你一个小孩子，老老实实待着吧。这种危险的事情还是交给我。","source_cn":"你一个小孩子，老老实实待着吧。这种危险的事情还是交给我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50D5D3F50700774B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1010505014:0":{"text":"维伦先生，我手上有黄金邀请函，他们不敢拿我怎么样，没人比我更合适了。","source_cn":"维伦先生，我手上有黄金邀请函，他们不敢拿我怎么样，没人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9615C9AF4AC3BD20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1010505015:0":{"text":"何况，正因为我想报答你们，所以才决定跟来，请你们理解。","source_cn":"何况，正因为我想报答你们，所以才决定跟来，请你们理解。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFB7994B5C0FE7511","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"何况，正因为我想报答你们，所以才决定跟来，请你们理解。","female":"何况，正因为我想报答你们，所以才决定跟来，请你们理解。","variant_male_record_index":"98407","variant_female_record_index":"98408","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:23:1010505015":{"text":"何况，正因为我想报答你们，所以才决定跟来，请你们理解。","source_cn":"何况，正因为我想报答你们，所以才决定跟来，请你们理解。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFB7994B5C0FE7511","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"何况，正因为我想报答你们，所以才决定跟来，请你们理解。","female":"何况，正因为我想报答你们，所以才决定跟来，请你们理解。","variant_male_record_index":"98407","variant_female_record_index":"98408","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1010505016:0":{"text":"放心吧，我不仅财运好，其他方面的运气也很好。","source_cn":"放心吧，我不仅财运好，其他方面的运气也很好。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5127D60CDBCFEF5D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"放心吧，我不仅财运好，其他方面的运气也很好。","female":"放心吧，我不仅财运好，其他方面的运气也很好。","variant_male_record_index":"98409","variant_female_record_index":"98410","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:27:1010505018:0":{"text":"罗万做了几个深呼吸，独自走向了堵在洞窟前方的那两个人","source_cn":"罗万做了几个深呼吸，独自走向了堵在洞窟前方的那两个人","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60A699E9507F7BFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1010505019:0":{"text":"你们好！我想问个路。\n请问弗朗茨的宅邸在哪个方向？我是来参加<style=\"highlight\">黄金宴会</style>的。","source_cn":"你们好！我想问个路。\\n请问弗朗茨的宅邸在哪个方向？我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6125AA00EB0C7CB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1010505020:0":{"text":"请看，这是我收到的邀请函。","source_cn":"请看，这是我收到的邀请函。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA936EA15C487A0B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_mal